---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
title="About | TahaRb"
description="Learn more about Taha and the story behind TahaRb."
>

<section class="about">

<div class="container">

<span class="eyebrow">
ABOUT
</span>

<h1>
Building ideas that help people grow.
</h1>

<p class="lead">

TahaRb is a place where curiosity,
self-development, technology and entrepreneurship
come together.

Every article, resource and project is created with
one purpose:

to help people learn faster, think better,
and build a meaningful future.

</p>

</div>

</section>

<section class="story">

<div class="container narrow">

<h2>
My Story
</h2>

<p>

My journey has never been traditional.

I learned by experimenting, building,
making mistakes, and starting again.

Over the years I became fascinated by
self-development, books, artificial intelligence,
productivity, websites and online business.

Instead of keeping what I learned to myself,
I decided to build TahaRb as a place to share
practical ideas that anyone can apply.

</p>

</div>

</section>

<section class="mission">

<div class="container narrow">

<h2>
My Mission
</h2>

<p>

My goal is simple.

Create practical content that helps people
grow personally and professionally while building
a trusted library of ideas, resources,
and digital tools.

</p>

</div>

</section>

<section class="topics">

<div class="container">

<h2>
What You'll Find Here
</h2>

<div class="grid">

<div>

<h3>Self Development</h3>

<p>
Mindset, habits and lifelong learning.
</p>

</div>

<div>

<h3>Artificial Intelligence</h3>

<p>
Useful AI tools and practical workflows.
</p>

</div>

<div>

<h3>Entrepreneurship</h3>

<p>
Building digital businesses and online projects.
</p>

</div>

<div>

<h3>Books</h3>

<p>
Thoughtful recommendations and timeless lessons.
</p>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<section class="quote">

<div class="container narrow">

<blockquote>

Small improvements repeated consistently
create extraordinary lives.

</blockquote>

</div>

</section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>

.about{

padding-top:120px;

}

.eyebrow{

letter-spacing:3px;

font-size:.85rem;

color:var(--text-light);

}

h1{

font-size:clamp(3rem,7vw,5rem);

margin:20px 0 35px;

}

.lead{

max-width:760px;

font-size:1.2rem;

line-height:2;

color:var(--text-light);

}

.narrow{

max-width:760px;

}

.story,
.mission,
.quote{

padding:100px 0;

}

.story h2,
.mission h2,
.topics h2{

font-size:2.5rem;

margin-bottom:25px;

}

.story p,
.mission p{

line-height:2;

font-size:1.1rem;

color:var(--text-light);

}

.topics{

padding:100px 0;

}

.grid{

display:grid;

grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);

gap:35px;

margin-top:50px;

}

.grid div{

background:white;

border:1px solid var(--border);

border-radius:18px;

padding:35px;

}

.grid h3{

margin-bottom:12px;

}

.grid p{

color:var(--text-light);

line-height:1.8;

}

blockquote{

font-family:"Cormorant Garamond",serif;

font-size:2.4rem;

text-align:center;

line-height:1.5;

}

@media(max-width:768px){

.grid{

grid-template-columns:1fr;

}

}

</style>